# Shelfware needs NO secret to answer the ticker question.
#   python3 -m shelfware MS        -> roster from the committed snapshot (labelled), status LIVE and keyless
#
# Optional. A free Basic key from https://coinmarketcap.com/api moves the roster leg to a live
# call (1 credit per ticker) and unlocks the full census (`python3 -m shelfware census`, ~5 credits).
# Never commit it. The CLI reads it from the environment only.
# CMC_API_KEY=
